  "bio": "Rafa Souza Tattoo is a highly skilled artist specializing in lettering, black&gray, and fineline tattoos, having honed their craft since 2013. Working out of Campo Largo, Brazil, Rafa is renowned for creating exclusive, high-quality designs that are tailored to each client's vision. Their dedication to professionalism is evident in every piece of art they create, ensuring that clients leave the studio with a masterpiece inked on their skin.\nPrice: $$\nCurrent location: Campo Largo, Parana, Brazil",
